# Build context excludes for the web image.
#
# The web Dockerfile runs `COPY . .`, so without this file every file in
# apps/web enters the build stage -- including a locally-created
# apps/web/.env.local holding a real VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN. A multi-stage build
# would not put it in the final image, but `cache-to: type=gha,mode=max`
# exports every intermediate stage, and release.yml wrote build stages to the
# Actions cache, where anyone with actions:read on the repo can read it.
#
# This file is a security control. Do not relax the .env rules.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vercel

# Installed/derived trees: `npm ci` above already produced the right one, and
# copying the host's would overlay it with a possibly wrong-arch stale copy.
node_modules
dist
build
coverage

# Android/Capacitor is not part of the web image
android

# Local agent/tooling state and logs
*.log
.vscode
.idea
.zcode
live_evidence

# Docs and tests are not build inputs
*.md
src/test
run_web_tests.ps1
